            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141504473?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">I splitted the kate package into 2 packages :</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Kate</li>\n<li>Kwrite</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Solved <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4295915989\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/511733\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/511733/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/511733\">#511733</a></p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Things done</h2>\n\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li>Built on platform:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> x86_64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> aarch64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> x86_64-darwin</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> aarch64-darwin</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Tested, as applicable:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a href=\"https://nixos.org/manual/nixos/unstable/index.html#sec-nixos-tests\" rel=\"nofollow\">NixOS tests</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/nixos/tests\">nixos/tests</a>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-lis